BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:IU Asian Culture Center
DTSTART:20261029T210000Z
DTEND:20261029T220000Z
LOCATION:Asian Culture Center (807 E 10th street\, Bloomington\, IN)
SUMMARY:Algorithmic Culture: All Eyes on AI\, Culture and Community
DESCRIPTION:Join us at the ACC for an evening discussing culture\, langua
 ge and AI through various lenses. Snigdha Khanna is an IU doctoral resear
 cher in Cognitive Science and Computational Linguistics. We meet and eat 
 and share thoughts and questions on widespread use of Generative AI\, how
  it must be reshaping human culture\, experiences\, and expressions. Thro
 ugh a conversational format\, we gather to build community through the ma
 ssive cultural shift we are living through.  &#160\;All Indiana Universit
 y events\, groups\, activities\, and&#160\;educational\, cultural\, and h
 istorical observances welcome all IU students and other members of the In
 diana University community.For more information\, view this event in BeIn
 volved (https://beinvolved.indiana.edu/event/12772455).
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p>  Join us at the ACC for an evening discu
 ssing culture\, language and AI through various lenses. Snigdha Khanna is
  an IU doctoral researcher in Cognitive Science and Computational Linguis
 tics. We meet and eat and share thoughts and questions on widespread use 
 of Generative AI\, how it must be reshaping human culture\, experiences\,
  and expressions. Through a conversational format\, we gather to build co
 mmunity through the massive cultural shift we are living through.</p><br 
 /><p>  &#160\;</p><br /><p><span data-olk-copy-source="MessageBody">All I
 ndiana University events\, groups\, activities\, and&#160\;educational\, 
 cultural\, and historical observances welcome all IU students and other m
 embers of the Indiana University community.</span></p><br /><strong>For m
 ore information\, <a href="https://beinvolved.indiana.edu/event/12772455"
 >view this event in BeInvolved</a>.</strong>
