 take a break from the digital world\, and most importantly\, meet new fri
 ends in person. You do not need to be an expert to join us\, just bring y
 our enthusiasm and a willingness to learn!  &#160\;All Indiana University
  events\, groups\, activities\, and&#160\;educational\, cultural\, and hi
 storical observances welcome all IU students and other members of the Ind
 iana University community.For more information\, view this event in BeInv
 olved (https://beinvolved.indiana.edu/event/12898213).
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW124089327 
 BCX0">Once associated with older generations\, Mahjong has now found a ne
 w home among the young.&#160\;</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW12408
 9327 BCX0">Social clubs have&#160\;</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW
 124089327 BCX0">emerged</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW124089327 BC
 X0">&#160\;dedicated to playing Mahjong to reconnect with culture and\, m
 ore importantly\, to foster new friendships. At the ACC\, we offer a casu
 al and informal Mahjong experience\, perfect for those looking to learn t
 he game\, take a break from the digital world\, and most importantly\, me
 et new friends in person. You do not need to be an expert to join us\, ju
 st bring your enthusiasm and a willingness to learn!</span></p><br /><p> 
