LOCATION:Asian Culture Center (807 E 10th street\, Bloomington\, IN)
SUMMARY:Tara\, Mag-Tagalog Tayo!: Learn and Experience Filipino Language 
 & Culture
DESCRIPTION:Come spend&#160\;your Thursdays at the ACC practicing your Ta
 galog and celebrating Filipino culture! Every Thursday from 5:00-6:00 PM\
 ,&#160\;we'll&#160\;host a variety of language-immersive events with Kenn
 eth P. De la Piedra\, EdD&#160\;—(included but not limited to) language
  table\, speech practice\, Tagalog tutoring\, cooking workshops—to intr
 oduce the aspects that Filipino culture has to offer. Tara\, Mag-Tagalog 
 Tayo!&#160\;is open to everyone\, whether&#160\;you're&#160\;a beginner\,
  fluent speaker\, or simply curious about Filipino culture.&#160\;  &#160
 \;All Indiana University events\, groups\, activities\, and&#160\;educati
 onal\, cultural\, and historical observances welcome all IU students and 
 other members of the Indiana University community.For more information\, 
 view this event in BeInvolved (https://beinvolved.indiana.edu/event/12842
 787).
